    "tab_content_E6Fhye": {
      "type": "tab-content",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Ktjp6B": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_624756.png",
            "image_second": true,
            "tab_title": "Step 1. Order Has Been Processed",
            "title": "Step 1. Order Has Been Processed",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<p>The processing time is indicated on each product page. Transit time is additional. So, the total time to receive your order = processing time + transportation time. We have a \"Processing & Transit Time Calculator\" available on each product page which can calculate the estimated time to receive your order.  </p><p>For additional reference on where your items will come from:</p><ul><li>French Fitness Equipment: 100% from Benicia, CA warehouse</li><li>Brand New Equipment (non French Fitness brand): 15% shop from Benicia, CA while the rest will be coming from other States.</li><li>Remanufactured Equipment: 80% are from Benicia, CA. 20% from other states</li></ul><p><a href=\"#\" title=\"#\">See shipping options</a></p>",
            "list_items": "",
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "icon": "tick",
            "image-text": "<p><strong>Processing & Transit Time Calculator</strong></p><p>Our new website feature lets you estimate delivery times by selecting your preferred service and entering your zip code. This applies to US and Canada zip codes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_LnteRk": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_624757.png",
            "image_second": true,
            "tab_title": "Step 2. Order Has Been Shipped",
            "title": "Step 2. Order Has Been Shipped",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<p>Tracking information will be sent to you via email within 24 hours upon shipping. Here’s what you can expect to receive from us, based on your chosen mode of delivery:</p><ul><li>For <strong>Curbside delivery</strong> -  we’ll provide the carrier we used for shipment + the tracking number</li><li>For <strong>Room of Choice delivery</strong> - we’ll provide the carrier, tracking number, and the installer's information</li><li>For <strong>Parcel deliveries</strong> - we’ll provide you with the USPS/FedEx tracking number</li></ul>",
            "list_items": "",
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "icon": "tick",
            "image-text": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_9dyUUP": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_1_636a83da-15ea-41ac-920c-0d9180a796a5.png",
            "image_second": true,
            "tab_title": "Step 3. Delivery",
            "title": "Step 3. Delivery",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "The information below will provide you with the details of what to expect on your delivery, based on your chosen mode of delivery/shipping. This includes what to expect when ordering parcel, curbside, garage, or room of choice delivery. If you have any clarifications about your shipment, feel free to Contact Us.",
