            "richtext": "<ul><li>Missing/damaged parts or small dents fall under this category</li><li>Sign the delivery receipt, form, or proof of delivery and indicate the words “shipping damage” next to your signature</li><li>Option to Accept or Reject Delivery? You have either option available. We would recommend accepting the machine and we will send you the replacement parts along with an installer to fix the damaged part. This will be the quickest way. If the customer does not feel comfortable with this arrangement, you have the option to reject the delivery and contact us to discuss the next steps </li></ul>",
